{
  "schema": "lgpe-gamedata-v1",
  "format": "LGPE-message",
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "id": "msg_main0730_rocketchief_01",
      "hash": "9e258dee4a30c3a0",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "？？？「……光看這個\\n西爾佛檢視鏡就能知道……"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "id": "msg_main0730_rocketchief_02",
      "hash": "9e2590ee4a30c8b9",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "西爾佛公司所擁有的科技實力\\n可以說是完全足以幫助我們\\r\\n實現火箭隊的遠大理想。"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "id": "msg_main0730_rocketboss_01",
      "hash": "e707943c02420ee2",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "？？？「哼……！\\n你說這機器能讓人看見\\r\\n原本看不見的東西是吧。\\c\\n不過是個無聊的玩具罷了。\\n只是……"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "id": "msg_main0730_rocketboss_02",
      "hash": "e707933c02420d2f",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "也好。\\c\\n阿波羅，你就繼續進行\\n佔領西爾佛公司的計畫吧。"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "id": "msg_main0730_rocketchief_03",
      "hash": "9e258fee4a30c706",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "？？？「遵命……！"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "id": "msg_main0730_rocketchief_04",
      "hash": "9e2592ee4a30cc1f",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "為什麼會有小孩子在這裡？"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "id": "msg_main0730_rocketchief_05",
      "hash": "9e2591ee4a30ca6c",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "竟然一聲不響地偷聽\\n我們剛才的談話，\\r\\n真是令人不快。"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "id": "msg_main0730_rocketchief_06",
      "hash": "9e2594ee4a30cf85",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "……我是火箭隊的幹部，\\n我叫阿波羅。\\c\\n就算[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳是個小孩子，\\n我也不會手下留情的！"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "id": "msg_main0730_dummy_01",
      "hash": "667ff12551a51f6b",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 8]"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "id": "msg_main0730_rocketchief_07",
      "hash": "9e2593ee4a30cdd2",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "阿波羅「阪、阪木老大，\\n請您原諒我。\\r\\n身為幹部的我竟然……"
    }
  ],
  "unpaired_labels": [
    {
      "id": "msg_main_event_0730_max",
      "hash": "e58ab4450f5a11a1"
    }
  ]
}
